      "widgets_values": [
        "EXPERIMENTAL — ONE-PASS THREE-ANGLE GUITAR REF2VA\n\nThis workflow re-films the source guitar performance from exactly three camera angles in one H3 pass. It is not a recursive Context Loop.\n\n• Load Video is preset to 3ClbaJYWVO4_000030.mp4 from ComfyUI/input.\n• Reference Video Prep samples the 30 fps source at H3's 24 fps and selects 209 valid frames (8.708 seconds).\n• The paired source waveform is copied from 00:00.000 to 00:08.708 exactly. It conditions Ref2VA and replaces the generated audio at export.\n• The prompt preserves the performer, clothing, cream guitar, hand choreography, and timing seen in the source, but removes its static pedal card, watermark, and text layout.\n• Change length only to another H3-valid value satisfying length % 17 == 5 and covered by both source picture and source audio. Prep intentionally refuses padding and time-stretching.\n• Select model paths available in your installation before queueing."
